<title>UK: EU raises medium quality wheat import duty.</title>
<headline>EU raises medium quality wheat import duty.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Friday raise duties on transatlantic imports of medium quality soft wheat to 56.63 Ecus a tonne from 51.06 Ecus, European Commission figures showed.</p>
<p>Duties on other grain imports will remain unchanged.</p>
</text>
